msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_778A2AAE_CCB7_42BA_B2C6_85F3D97DBA6F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so we tried to make the best of what we were able to take in between the three of us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫поэтому мы втроем старались делать все, что могли."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0A4E61B0_4FB0_44B4_A6E4_86DA8AEAA2BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d8319271cd5c47dbe7a3a9bb02aa03f0c274f1ca39418d5bd505287d6a48551
